        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 52,
      "author": {
        "id": 1583108
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-14T08:42:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The logical_max_x/y and physical_max_x/y have already read from device through I2C in driver. So, these four parameters do not need to be defined in device tree.\nThe code is revised that the hid tp device is registered after touchpad driver initializes.\nBesides, the max pressure value is defined in dts. It can be defined per project.\nPlease help review it again, thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "84b0bfc9_5a12ac53",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 52,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "c2744d8d7714c443c309dd71daf14c5283065152",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
