      "message": "I don\u0027t have their programming guide.\n\nI usually just reference from their kernel driver. Is `ETP_I2C_REPORT_DESC_CMD` cmd in https://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/latest/source/drivers/input/mouse/elan_i2c_i2c.c#L139 what you need?",
